mcp-privacy-guard bundles the following third-party data.

Public Suffix List
  File: engine/src/mcp_privacy_guard/data/public_suffix_list.dat
  Source: https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat
  Licence: Mozilla Public License 2.0 (https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/)
  Refreshed with scripts/update-public-suffix.sh.

Common words (SCOWL)
  File: engine/src/mcp_privacy_guard/data/common_words.txt
  Source: SCOWL, the Spell Checker Oriented Word Lists, now the English Speller Database
  (ESDB), https://github.com/en-wl/wordlist (v2), by Kevin Atkinson.
  Licence: MIT-like. Use, copy, modify, distribute and sell are permitted without fee if the
  copyright notice stays in all copies; the notice heads the file. Built by
  scripts/update-common-words.py: lower-case headwords and inflections of US spelling, size 35,
  three letters or more, no abbreviations or proper nouns, plus a few networking terms.
  The ESDB notice also names Australian English (not used) and the UK Advanced Cryptics
  Dictionary (sizes above 80, not used).
